"MENÚ SUPERIOR / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Estilo de subrayado"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3966-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<span class=\"label_green\">TIP</span> You can add multiple highlights "
#| "and notes to the same section of text. If they are overlapping, when you "
